  "research.basedefense.lumberjack_house.desc": "A narrow house with a long tree yard. The builder builds it, then a lumberjack moves in.",
  "research.basedefense.farmer_house.work": "Farmer: tends the garden.\nWorks on his own and puts everything into the house chest. Every dawn — 3 random finds:\nLvl 1: bread ×1, beetroot ×3, potato ×2, carrot ×3, melon ×3, coins ×3\nLvl 2: bread ×1, beetroot ×5, potato ×4, carrot ×5, melon ×6, coins ×6\nLvl 3: bread ×2, beetroot ×8, potato ×6, carrot ×7, melon ×9, coins ×10\nFood per day: 12 / 16 / 23\nUpgrades: 20 and 60 coins",
  "research.basedefense.rancher_house.work": "Rancher: looks after the pen.\nWorks on his own and puts everything into the house chest. Every dawn — 3 random finds:\nLvl 1: beef, pork, mutton or chicken ×2, eggs ×3, leather ×2, wool ×3, coins ×3\nLvl 2: meat ×3, eggs ×6, leather ×3, wool ×5, coins ×6\nLvl 3: meat ×5, eggs ×10, leather ×5, wool ×8, coins ×10\nFood per day: 13 / 18 / 25\nUpgrades: 20 and 60 coins",
  "research.basedefense.cook_house.work": "Cook: give him food from your hand — it becomes ingredient points (bread = 10). With 30 points he cooks one dish per day into the house chest:\nLvl 1: pumpkin pie 2–3, cake 1–2, beetroot soup 2–3 or bread 3–4\nLvl 2: pie 3–4, cake 2–3, soup 3–5, bread 4–6 or coins ×10\nLvl 3: same, but coins ×15\nFood per day: 12 / 16 / 23\nUpgrades: 20 and 60 coins",
  "research.basedefense.miner_house.work": "Miner: works at the bottom of the mine.\nWorks on his own and puts everything into the house chest. Every dawn — 2 random finds:\nLvl 1: iron ore 4–5, gold ore 2–3, copper ore 8–10, coal 9–12\nLvl 2: iron ore 6–7, gold ore 4–5, coal 15–18, diamond ×1, coins ×10\nLvl 3: iron ore 10–14, gold ore 6–8, coal 20–22, diamonds ×2, coins ×13\nFood per day: 13 / 18 / 25\nUpgrades: 20 and 60 coins",
  "research.basedefense.blacksmith_house.work": "The blacksmith's work comes later. For now he just lives in the settlement.\nFood per day: 6",
  "research.basedefense.lumberjack_house.work": "Lumberjack: chops trees on the plot.\nWorks on his own and puts everything into the house chest. Every dawn — logs of one random kind:\nLvl 1: 16 logs\nLvl 2: 25 logs\nLvl 3: 35 logs and 6 coins\nFood per day: 12 / 16 / 23\nUpgrades: 20 and 60 coins",
  "screen.basedefense.settler.status.no_chest": "No chest! Loot waiting: %s",
  "screen.basedefense.settler.status.chest_full": "The chest is full! Waiting: %s",
