  "research.basedefense.builder_house": "Builder's House",
  "research.basedefense.builder_house.desc": "The first house of the settlement: it builds itself in seconds. A builder moves in and builds all other houses. Put building materials into the chests of his house.",
  "research.basedefense.builder_house.work": "Builder: builds houses from blueprints.\nChoose a house in the Building Tablet and place it — a construction site appears. Right-click it to see the needed blocks.\nPut materials into the chests of the builder's house (there are 6), he takes them himself.\nFarmer's house build time: 4 min (lvl 1), 3 min (lvl 2), 1.5 min (lvl 3); bigger houses take longer.\nFood per day: 12 / 16 / 23\nUpgrades: 20 and 60 coins",
  "message.basedefense.house.site_created": "Construction site ready! Put materials into the builder's house chests — he will come and build. Right-click the block for the material list.",
